    "literal.a8cbbd988c63":
      "Ripoti masuala mapya ya bidhaa ndani ya saa 24 baada ya kujifungua ukitumia picha wazi za bidhaa, lebo na vifungashio vya nje.",
    "literal.4a1c662122d4":
      "Ripoti masuala ya bidhaa zilizofungiwa ndani ya siku 7 baada ya kuwasilishwa. Weka bidhaa na kifurushi hadi usaidizi uthibitishe azimio hilo.",
    "literal.429fa4aeee87": "Omba kurejeshewa",
    "literal.c26bf60fed37": "Umeomba",
    "literal.5c4bc97ee5d0": "Weka upya nenosiri",
    "literal.ef7a058f81ba": "Chaguo za azimio",
    "literal.b41c7580956d": "Imetolewa kwa uwajibikaji",
    "literal.b3bd0b5a7049": "Rejea",
    "literal.c7199d9e9593": "Kubaki",
    "literal.29160ec9d703": "Rejesha hali ya ombi:",
    "literal.9582a02f141f": "Hurejesha",
    "literal.3322a2092ac9": "Kurejesha na kurejesha",
    "literal.7749fcf802c4": "Kurejesha:",
    "literal.61e62b213a1a": "hakiki",
    "literal.22088e00d9fe": "Kagua kikapu chako kabla ya kulipia.",
