    "literal.f10db00bf203":
      "A tuntuɓi tallafi da wuri-wuri. Yawancin lokaci ana iya yin canje-canje kafin a fara rabawa, tattarawa ko girbi.",
    "literal.e9dfe5e249e6":
      "A tuntuɓi tallafin True Grit ta imel don oda, gonaki, samfura da haɗin gwiwa.",
