    "literal.73c79cc2ea23": "Ba a samun tattaunawa a yanzu.",
    "literal.bdcde192bb08": "Aika rhythm",
    "literal.5aa2a6954d76": "misali. WELCOME15",
    "literal.cd5df7101684":
      "Kowace kuri'a ana yiwa alama alama a gona tare da ranar girbi ko niƙa. Wannan alamar yana bin abincin ta hanyar duba ingancin, tattarawa da aikawa - don haka akwatin da ke kan ma'aunin ku zai iya gaya muku daidai inda aka fara.",
    "literal.4c61a44f896d": "Edit & rebmit",
    "literal.9a5b8cc4be68": "Shirya ƙaddamarwa",
    "literal.0ad8581593c6": "Shirya abin da kuka gabatar",
    "literal.73c3af11a507": "Rubutun edita",
    "literal.84add5b29527": "Imel",
    "literal.c94d3175a656": "adireshin imel",
    "literal.3338c0d27c36": "ji dadin odar ku.",
    "literal.705d8e0e5c4a": "Shigar da lambar",
    "literal.f847e052ea78": "Kowane mako 2",
    "literal.c98273d9aa04":
      "Kowane abu yana shiga cikin kwandon ku akan farashinsa; Ana amfani da ajiyar dam a wurin biya da zarar kwandon ku ya riƙe cikakken saiti.",
    "literal.7f3932f9cb96": "Kowane wata",
    "literal.e44ee1c0c8c5":
      "Kowace gonar abokin tarayya tana riƙe da takardar shaidar NPOP ko PGS-Indiya na yanzu. Muna duba takaddun a kan jirgin, tabbatar da shi tare da hukumar da ke bayarwa, kuma muna sake duba kowace shekara. Takaddun shaida da tagogin ingancinsu ana yin rikodin su a kan kowane da'awar samfur.",
    "literal.a2913e2a5b63":
      "Kowane samfur a cikin kasuwar True Grit - ƙwararrun kwayoyin halitta, an gano su zuwa gonaki da aka tabbatar.",
    "literal.043058e2050c": "Kowace mako",
    "literal.d8142a1f5554":
      "Jagora-Shaidar kan lakabi, ajiya, dafa abinci na yanayi da samun mafi kyawun ƙima daga kowane oda.",
    "literal.1554628ad103": "Bincika kasuwa",
    "literal.9f194d76fe9c": "Binciko shafin",
    "literal.a4adec7fe60c": "Ba a saita shigar da littafin Facebook ba.",
    "literal.95a347b954ff": "Haɗin gwiwar gaskiya",
    "literal.78797843e6e3":
      "ana buga labarun gona, bayanan takaddun shaida da cikakkun bayanan ganowa ga abokin ciniki. Kar a kwafi abun ciki na rukunin yanar gizo ko kadarori ba tare da izini ba.",
    "literal.ca9cc88e7cb6": "Manoma",
    "literal.bda1c4b43d3a":
      "Dole ne gonaki su riƙe takardar shaidar NPOP ko PGS-Indiya na yanzu, su yarda da gano matakin ƙima, kuma suyi aiki tare da samuwa na yanayi maimakon wadata da yawa da ba a san su ba. Abokan kayan abinci dole ne su danna, niƙa ko shirya cikin ƙananan batches tare da kwanan wata da aka nuna a fili.",
    "literal.c62c2967f9ec":
      "Gonana suna saita farashin su tare da mu a kan lokaci, kafin girbi, kuma ana biyan su a kan aikawa - ba a kan sayar da mu ba. Ƙungiyoyi kamar Anandvan suna raba ribar ta wurin da aka ba da gudummawa.",
    "literal.32b1045d5cfa": "Amsoshi masu sauri don umarni, bayarwa da tambayoyin samfur.",
    "literal.5234f11bdf7e": "Na farko, tabbatar da wayar hannu",
    "literal.7384e7db2d84": "gyara matsalar oda",
    "literal.1416b313e069":
      "Fulu, fulawa da mai daga ɗimbin yawa na yanzu tare da niƙa, latsawa ko kwanakin girbin da ake gani akan fakitin.",
    "literal.2e2b05c73fd0":
      "Don neman oda, haɗa da bayanin odar ku. Don tambayoyin gona ko samfur, haɗa da sunan samfurin da birni.",
    "literal.4c29f7f03358": "An manta kalmar sirri?",
    "literal.f313d52bc92a": "Ana ƙarawa akai-akai",
    "literal.37d4fef3bbe1": "Sai da yawa tare",
    "literal.64724410034b":
      "Sabo da ƙananan kayayyaki na iya siyarwa ko canzawa tare da yanayin girbi. Idan ba a iya cika odar da aka tabbatar ba, tallafi zai ba da canji, mayar da kuɗi ko kiredit.",
    "literal.024e0bbc2808":
      "Sabon abinci yana da ɗan lokaci, don haka ana sarrafa dawowa ta hanyar hotuna, cikakkun bayanai da kuma bitar tallafi cikin sauri maimakon a nemi ku dawo da kayan abinci.",
    "literal.ae43d74ec066": "Sabbin 'ya'yan itace",
    "literal.10d88756fdeb":
      "Sabon girbin kwayoyin halitta da iyakataccen faɗuwar yanayi daga True Grit's ingantacciyar hanyar sadarwa ta gona.",
    "literal.45de21d770ad":
      "Sabon samfurin yana bin kalandar girbi da jiragen ruwa a cikin tsarin zagayowar mako-mako.",
    "literal.85c8d2606382":
      "Sabobin samar da jiragen ruwa a ƙayyadaddun kwanakin aikawa. Kayayyakin kayan abinci yawanci suna barin wurin cikawa cikin kwanaki biyu na aiki, tare da sarrafa sarkar sanyi a inda ake buƙata.",
    "literal.38a4da7af005": "Saboda taga samfurin",
    "literal.e1a5fa6fd5b5": "Daga abokan cinikinmu",
    "literal.e4b5620fa978": "Daga gona zuwa kofar ku",
    "literal.3a1863213b7d": "Daga kicin",
    "literal.0df17882c591": "Daga kasa daya",
    "literal.e8e1b5046040": "Daga wannan gona",
    "literal.ff4a9ac0c49d": "daga ingantattun sayayya",
    "literal.1c246a022284": "cika:",
    "literal.eeb692087d62": "Cikakken suna",
    "literal.a09066301ab8": "Ya yi kyau tare da",
    "literal.79fc372dc790": "Madalla da sani",
    "literal.e4628ceb88eb": "Ba a saita shigar da Google ba.",
    "literal.71a6cee5d894":
      "Shin kuna da girke-girke da ya cancanci rabawa? Sanya shi ga al'umma kuma editocin mu za su sake duba shi.",
    "literal.ddfbcf5040f4":
      "ana yanke ganye da wuri, a sanyaya su cikin sauri kuma a ba da fifiko ga gajerun hanyoyin isar da saƙo.",
    "literal.20f41fd9573c": "An zaɓe da hannu",
    "literal.c192c2e5957c": "Shiryar da isar da girbi, wanda aka tsara shi kusa da sabo.",
    "literal.fd25edf497e5": "Girbi:",
    "literal.61d992ed0060":
      "Shin kuna da labari? Sanya wani rubutu kuma editocin mu za su sake duba shi.",
    "literal.1ab08ca864f6": "Shin kuna da shawara?",
    "literal.c47ae15370cf": "Taimako",
    "literal.6e69fbcaa278": "Abubuwan da ke fitowa daga kasuwa",
    "literal.70f8bb9a8a53": "Gida",
    "literal.01f39b3ca7e1": "Gida / titi",
    "literal.f8551a6a36f3": "Yadda oda ke motsawa",
    "literal.e8db65674a9b": "Saya a cikin saiti kuma ajiye - duba Bundusa →",
    "literal.20010c3fde52":
      "Shafa hanyoyin, lokaci na gaske da sassauƙan hanyoyi don dafa abin da ke cikin lokaci.",
    "literal.e3896a930398": "Rufe taga",
    "literal.118a99898154": "comment",
    "literal.bfd58ee3a270": "Al'umma",
    "literal.ee084583c92d": "Tattaunawar al'umma",
    "literal.8cc7acb8f360": "An tabbatar",
    "literal.2b658ffd9420": "Tattaunawa ta hanyar sadarwa",
    "literal.96bd106a4007": "Yadda yanayi ke aiki",
    "literal.0a584669f425": "Yadda suke girma",
    "literal.1f4827ffb9f1":
      "Yadda True Grit ke tattarawa, amfani da kare asusun abokin ciniki da odar bayanai.",
    "literal.5359aab7479f":
      "Yadda True Grit ke tattarawa, aikawa da isar da odar abinci na yanayi na lokaci-lokaci.",
    "literal.082ab95e8698": "Yadda muke zabar abokan hulda",
    "literal.7f886aa82f1a": "Yadda muke amfani da shi",
    "literal.b45cfbed2cde":
      "Idan ba a iya kammala isarwa ba, tallafi na gaba zai iya tuntuɓar ku tare da samfurin da aka samu. yanayin.",
    "literal.3eca579e7087": "Idan imel ɗin yana da asusu, hanyar sake saiti yana kan hanya.",
    "literal.e902b7895b9c":
      "Idan abincin ya zo ba daidai ba, lalacewa ko ƙasa da ma'auni, muna gyara shi.",
    "literal.b6bd42e4e730": "A ci gaba",
    "literal.ae6c1c537612": "A kakar yanzu",
    "literal.486523f99918":
      "Hade abin da ba daidai ba da duk wani bayani da zai taimaka wajen tallafawa.",
    "literal.062e79bd33f1": "Ƙara yawa",
    "literal.d9fc1187f1d6": "Lambobin wayar hannu ta Indiya. Za mu aika maka da lambar lamba 6.",
    "literal.ca195d50ca27": "Bayanan da muke tattarawa",
    "literal.7ddfd264324f": "Ingredient",
    "literal.f9e84ee2ac46": "Abubuwa",
    "literal.67031441599f":
      "Abubuwa, matakai, shiri da lokacin dafa abinci - editocin mu suna duba kowane girke-girke kafin ya tafi kai tsaye.",
    "literal.44f0ca4fdc20": "Shin kuna sha'awar wannan samfurin?",
    "literal.5e90598e3465": "ana samunsa don sake yin oda.",
    "literal.e17f17fcd187":
      "An bayar da shi ga hanyar biyan kuɗi ta asali lokacin da maye gurbin ba ta da amfani ko samfurin ba ya samuwa.",
    "literal.b9f76d2edf21":
      "Wataƙila an sake masa suna, ba a buga shi, ko kuma ba a siyar da shi a ƙasarku.",
