    "literal.51ec1975eab6":
      "xogta macaamiisha waxa loo isticmaalaa in lagu socodsiiyo suuqa, ee looma isticmaalo in lagu qariyo.",
    "literal.66fa2631d38c": "Dib u eegisyada macaamiisha",
