    "literal.e76801c913c6": "dood lama helin",
    "literal.73c79cc2ea23": "Wadahadalada lama heli karo hadda.",
    "literal.bdcde192bb08": "Diri laxanka",
    "literal.5aa2a6954d76": "tus. SOO DHAWOOW15",
    "literal.cd5df7101684":
      "Qayb walba waxa lagu calaamadeeyay beerta iyadoo ay la socoto taariikhda ay soo go'aan ama wax lagu shiido. Summadaasi waxay raacdaa cuntada iyada oo loo marayo hubinta tayada, baakaynta iyo diritaanka - si sanduuqa miiskaagu kuu sheego sida saxda ah meesha ay ka bilaabatay.",
    "literal.4c61a44f896d": "Wax ka beddel oo dib u soo gudbi",
    "literal.9a5b8cc4be68": "wax ka beddel soo gudbinta",
    "literal.0ad8581593c6": "wax ka beddel soo gudbinta",
    "literal.73c3af11a507": "Xusuusta tafatiraha",
    "literal.84add5b29527": "Imayl",
    "literal.c94d3175a656": "ciwaanka iimaylka",
    "literal.3338c0d27c36": "ku raaxayso dalabkaga.",
    "literal.705d8e0e5c4a": "Geli koodka",
    "literal.f847e052ea78": "2dii asbuuc kasta",
    "literal.c98273d9aa04":
      "shay kastaa waxa uu ku gala dambiishaada qiimihiisii; kaydinta xidhmada waxa lagu dabaqayaa jeeg-bixinta marka dambiishaadu ay dhamaato.",
    "literal.7f3932f9cb96": "Bil kasta",
    "literal.e44ee1c0c8c5":
      "Beer kasta oo shuraako ah waxay haysataa shahaadada NPOP ama PGS-Hindiya hadda. Waxaan ka hubinaa waraaqaha marka la fuulayo, ka xaqiijino hay'adda soo saartay, oo dib u hubi sanad walba. Shahaadooyinka iyo daaqadaha ansaxnimadooda ayaa loo duubay si ka dhan ah sheegashada alaab kasta.",
    "literal.a2913e2a5b63":
      "Badeeco kasta oo ku jira suuqa True Grit - organic la shahaadiyay, oo la raad raacay beer la hubiyay.",
    "literal.043058e2050c": "Todobaad kasta",
    "literal.d8142a1f5554":
      "Hagaha caddaynta ay hoggaamiso ee ku saabsan sumadaha, kaydinta, karinta xilliyeedka iyo ka helidda qiime wanaagsan dalab kasta.",
    "literal.1554628ad103": "Sahami suuqa",
    "literal.9f194d76fe9c": "Baadi goobta",
    "literal.a4adec7fe60c": "So galida Facebook-ga looma habayn.",
    "literal.95a347b954ff": "Iskaashi cadaalad ah",
    "literal.78797843e6e3":
      "Sheekooyinka beeraha, tixraacyada caddaynta iyo faahfaahinta raadinta ayaa loo daabacaa daahfurnaanta macmiilka. Ha koobiyn macluumaadka goobta ama hantida sumadda fasax la'aan.",
    "literal.ca9cc88e7cb6": "Beeralayda",
    "literal.bda1c4b43d3a":
      "Beeruhu waa inay haystaan ​​shahaadada NPOP ama PGS-Hindiya hadda, ogolaadaan in la raadiyo heerar badan, oo ay ku shaqeeyaan helitaan xilliyeed halkii ay ka ahaan lahaayeen sahay badan oo qarsoodi ah. Wada-hawlgalayaasha qolka cuntada waa in ay riixaan, wax ku shubaan ama ku xidhaan dufcadyo yaryar oo taariikhuhu si cad u muujinayaan.",
    "literal.c62c2967f9ec":
      "Beeruhu waxay dejiyaan qiimahooda xilli xilliyeedka, ka hor goosashada, waxaana lagu bixiyaa dirista - maaha iibkayaga. Ururada sida Anandvan waxay wadaagaan faa'iidada aag wax lagu darsaday.",
    "literal.32b1045d5cfa": "Jawabaha degdega ah ee dalabaadka, keenista iyo su'aalaha alaabta.",
    "literal.5234f11bdf7e": "Marka hore, xaqiiji mobile kaaga",
    "literal.7384e7db2d84": "Hagaaji arrinta dalabka",
    "literal.1416b313e069":
      "Daqiiqda, hilibka iyo saliidaha laga soo raro meelo badan oo hadda jira oo leh shiidid, riixid ama taariikhaha goosashada ee ka muuqda xirmada.",
    "literal.2e2b05c73fd0":
      "Si aad u dalbato caawimaad, ku dar tixraaca dalabkaaga Su'aalaha beerta ama alaabta, ku dar magaca badeecada iyo magaalada.",
    "literal.4c29f7f03358": "la ilaaway erayga sirta ah?",
    "literal.f313d52bc92a": "inta badan lagu daro",
    "literal.37d4fef3bbe1": "sida badan si wadajir ah loo iibsado",
    "literal.64724410034b":
      "Alaabada cusub iyo kuwa yar yarba waa la iibin karaa ama waxay bedeli karaan xaaladaha goosashada. Haddii amarka la xaqiijiyay aan la fulin karin, taageerada ayaa bixin doonta beddel, lacag celin ama deyn.",
    "literal.024e0bbc2808":
      "Cuntada cusubi waa waqti xasaasi ah, sidaa darteed soo celinta waxaa lagu maamulaa sawiro, faahfaahin dufcaddii iyo dib u eegis taageero degdeg ah halkii lagu weydiin lahaa inaad soo celiso soo saarista.",
    "literal.ae43d74ec066": "miro cusub",
    "literal.10d88756fdeb":
      "Soo goynta organic ee cusub iyo dhibcaha xilliyeed xadidan ee ka imanaya shabakada beeraha ee True Grit ee la xaqiijiyay.",
    "literal.45de21d770ad":
      "Waxsoosaarka cusubi waxa uu raacayaa jadwalka goosashada iyo maraakiibta wareegyada todobaadlaha ah ee la qorsheeyay.",
    "literal.85c8d2606382":
      "Maraakiibta cusub waxay soo saaraan maalmo go'an oo la diro. Alaabta cuntada sida caadiga ah waxay ka baxaan xarunta buuxinta laba maalmood oo shaqo gudahood, iyadoo silsilad qabow lagu maamulayo meeshii loo baahdo.",
    "literal.38a4da7af005": "Daaqadda wax-soo-saarka cusub",
    "literal.e1a5fa6fd5b5": "ee macaamiisheena",
    "literal.e4b5620fa978": "Laga soo bilaabo beerta ilaa albaabkaaga",
    "literal.3a1863213b7d": "laga bilaabo jikada",
    "literal.0df17882c591": "isku mid carro",
    "literal.e8e1b5046040": "Beertan",
    "literal.ff4a9ac0c49d": "iibsiyo la hubiyay",
    "literal.1c246a022284": "fulinta:",
    "literal.eeb692087d62": "Magac buuxa",
    "literal.a09066301ab8": "Si fiican buu ula socdaa",
    "literal.79fc372dc790": "Wanaagsan in la ogaado",
    "literal.e4628ceb88eb": "Google galitaanka lama habayn.",
    "literal.71a6cee5d894":
      "Ma heshay cunto karinta mudan in la wadaago? U diyaari bulshada oo tafaftirayaasheena ayaa dib u eegi doona.",
    "literal.ddfbcf5040f4":
      "Cagaarka goor hore ayaa la gooyaa, si degdeg ah loo qaboojiyaa waxaana la kala horraysiiyaa boosaska gaynta ee marin-gaaban.",
    "literal.20f41fd9573c": "Gacan lagu doortay",
    "literal.c192c2e5957c": "Dhibaato-hoggaamineed, oo la qorsheeyey xilli cusub.",
    "literal.fd25edf497e5": "Harvest:",
    "literal.61d992ed0060":
      "Ma haysaa sheeko aad u sheegto? Dhig qoraal oo tafatirayaashayadu way eegi doonaan.",
    "literal.1ab08ca864f6": "Talo ma haysaa?",
    "literal.c47ae15370cf": "caawin",
    "literal.6e69fbcaa278": "Waxyaabaha ugu muhiimsan ee suuqa",
    "literal.70f8bb9a8a53": "Guriga",
    "literal.01f39b3ca7e1": "Guriga / wadada",
    "literal.f8551a6a36f3": "sida dalabaadka u dhaqaaqo",
    "literal.96bd106a4007": "Sida xilliyeedku u shaqeeyo",
    "literal.0a584669f425": "Sida ay u koraan",
    "literal.1f4827ffb9f1":
      "Sida True Grit u ururiso, u isticmaasho oo u ilaaliso akoontiga macaamiisha iyo dalbo xogta.",
    "literal.5359aab7479f":
      "Sida True Grit u xidhxidho, u dirto una keento dalabaadka cuntada dabiiciga ah ee xilliyeed.",
    "literal.082ab95e8698": "sida aan u doorano lamaanayaasha",
