    "literal.b45cfbed2cde":
      "Haddii keenista aan la dhammayn karin, taageerada ayaa kula soo xidhiidhi doonta isku dayga xiga ee la heli karo ama xallin wax ku ool ah oo ku salaysan xaaladda alaabta.",
    "literal.3eca579e7087":
      "Haddii iimaylkaasi uu leeyahay akoon, dib u habeynta ayaa ku soo socota.",
    "literal.e902b7895b9c":
      "Haddii cuntadu si khaldan u timaaddo, dhaawacantay ama ka hoosayso heerka caadiga ah, waanu saxnay.",
    "literal.b6bd42e4e730": "so socota",
    "literal.ae6c1c537612": "Xilliyada hadda",
    "literal.486523f99918":
      "Ku dar waxa khaldan iyo wixii tafaasiil ah ee caawin doona taageerada.",
    "literal.062e79bd33f1": "kordhi tirada",
    "literal.d9fc1187f1d6": "Lambarada mobilada Hindida Waxaan kuu soo diri doonaa kood 6-god ah.",
    "literal.ca195d50ca27": "macluumaad aanu uruurinay",
    "literal.7ddfd264324f": "Wax ka kooban",
    "literal.f9e84ee2ac46": "Waxyaabaha",
    "literal.67031441599f":
      "Waxyaabaha, tillaabooyinka, diyaarinta iyo wakhtiga karinta - tifaftirayaashayadu waxay dib u eegaan cunto kasta ka hor inta aanay si toos ah u bixin.",
    "literal.44f0ca4fdc20": "Ma xiiseeya alaabtan?",
    "literal.5e90598e3465": "ayaa diyaar u ah in lagu dalbo mar kale.",
    "literal.e17f17fcd187":
      "Waxaa lagu soo saaray qaabkii lacag bixinta ee asalka ahaa marka beddelka uusan ahayn mid la taaban karo ama badeecada aan la heli karin.",
    "literal.b9f76d2edf21":
      "Waxaa laga yaabaa in dib loo magacaabay, aan la daabicin, ama aan lagu iibin dalkaaga.",
    "literal.3a7d9767b123": "shay",
    "literal.ecdda59aea5e": "shay",
    "literal.38b4423360da": "wax soo saarka caleenta",
    "literal.8f26c6520d61": "soodejinaya",
    "literal.861a52ad3ebe": "soo dejinaysa doodaha…",
    "literal.f6f58e00b38c": "soo dejinta akoonkaaga",
    "literal.4430c2a33d54": "Soo shubaya dalabkaga…",
    "literal.93aa027526c3": "Soo dejinaya dalabaadkaaga…",
    "literal.757874187d8b": "Soo gudbintaada…",
    "literal.6d339ef025f8": "soo dejinaya rukunnadaada…",
    "literal.b04ba49f8486": "Loading...",
    "literal.33971f14e3e6": "Maamul True Grit akoonkaaga.",
    "literal.f0f863ac190a": "La kulan beeralayda",
