    "literal.d850ee188c7c": "Sirta cusub",
    "literal.bc981983e7f5": "Next",
    "literal.2dd829d824dc": "Ma jiro xidhmo toos ah hadda — dib u eeg mar dhow.",
    "literal.207b24fc9b92": "Weli faallooyin ma jiraan.",
    "literal.61e0b97a0c2e":
      "Wali wax wada hadal ah ma jiraan. Noqo qofka ugu horreeya ee bilaabaya.",
    "literal.2210d6e32ab6": "Weli wax dalabaad ah ma jiraan.",
    "literal.2a5f91d1c5f1": 'Natiijooyin ma jiraan "',
    "literal.09ac60a30137":
      "Weli faallooyin ma jiraan. Dib u eegisyadu waxay soo baxayaan halkan mar iibsadaha la xaqiijiyay uu ka qoro mid ka mid ah dalabkooda.",
    "literal.2e10e6dedc2f": "Wali lama soo gudbin.",
    "literal.a3db991383c6":
      'Weli is-diiwaangelin ma jiraan. Ka raadi "Subscribe & Save" bogga alaabta si aad u dejiso keenista soo noqnoqota.',
    "literal.a56516589a39": "aan lagu darin",
    "literal.71cf7967bc26": "Ma aha sida lagu tilmaamay",
