    "literal.2f70dd6e7fc7": "la wadaag cunto karinta",
    "literal.22b578303389": "Bulshada la wadaaga cunto karinta",
    "literal.f3cf2d8434ab": "La wadaag cunto karinta bulshada True Grit.",
    "literal.9626f79b20c6":
      "La wadaag sheeko, farsamo, ama wax aad baratay oo ku saabsan cunto cunid wanaagsan. Tafatirayaashayadu waxay dib u eegaan soo gudbin kasta ka hor intaysan si toos ah u bixin.",
