    "literal.c82b9007580f": "Si ku meel gaar ah looma heli karo Fadlan dib u eeg wax yar ama",
    "literal.b7152342a267": "Xajmiga",
    "literal.d1b3eb707638":
      "Qaar ka mid ah badeecooyinka cusub waxay soo raraan oo kaliya halka dariiqdu ay ku ilaalin karto tayada gudaha daaqada gaarsiinta ee la balan qaaday.",
