    "literal.d62a58df78aa":
      "Gukosora amasoko akunzwe kumasoko kugiciro cyagenwe - wongeyeho igitebo cyawe hamwe, mukanda rimwe.",
    "literal.68ce4efceb7e": "Gukosora amasoko akunda isoko, yaguzwe hamwe kubiciro byagenwe.",
