    "literal.055f4ce44734": "Ma tag azakudya (magawo olekanitsidwa ndi koma)",
    "literal.b524936d7aa1": "Kuchotsera",
    "literal.c255751d518c": "kukambitsirana",
    "literal.8fb937b602b4": "Zokambirana",
    "literal.e76801c913c6": "Zokambirana sizinapezeke",
    "literal.73c79cc2ea23": "Zokambirana sizikupezeka pakali pano.",
    "literal.bdcde192bb08": "Sipatch rhythm",
    "literal.5aa2a6954d76": "e.g. KULANDIRA 15",
    "literal.cd5df7101684":
      "Chigawo chilichonse chimayikidwa pafamu ndi tsiku lake lokolola kapena mphero. Chizindikirocho chimatsatira chakudyacho poyang'ana ubwino, kulongedza ndi kutumiza - kotero bokosi la pa counter yanu likhoza kukuwuzani komwe chinayambira.",
    "literal.4c61a44f896d": "Sinthani & tumizaninso",
    "literal.9a5b8cc4be68": "Sinthani kutumiza",
    "literal.0ad8581593c6": "Sinthani zomwe mwatumiza",
    "literal.73c3af11a507": "Zolemba za mkonzi",
    "literal.84add5b29527": "Imelo",
    "literal.c94d3175a656": "Imelo adilesi",
    "literal.3338c0d27c36": "Sangalalani ndi oda yanu.",
    "literal.705d8e0e5c4a": "Lowetsani khodi",
    "literal.f847e052ea78": "Masabata awiri aliwonse",
    "literal.c98273d9aa04":
      "Chilichonse chimalowa mudengu lanu pamtengo wake; kusunga mtolo kumayikidwa potuluka basiketi yanu ikakwana.",
    "literal.7f3932f9cb96": "Mwezi uliwonse",
    "literal.e44ee1c0c8c5":
      "Famu iliyonse yothandizana nayo ili ndi satifiketi yaposachedwa ya NPOP kapena PGS-India. Timayang'ana zolemba pakukwera, kuzitsimikizira ndi bungwe lomwe likupereka, ndikuwunikanso chaka chilichonse. Zikalata ndi mazenera ake ovomerezeka amajambulidwa motsutsana ndi zomwe akufuna.",
    "literal.a2913e2a5b63":
      "Chilichonse mumsika wa True Grit — organic certified, chimachokera ku famu yotsimikizika.",
    "literal.043058e2050c": "Mlungu uliwonse",
    "literal.d8142a1f5554":
      "umboni wokwanira wa zophikira, zolembedwa bwino ndi zosungirako zogulira nyengo iliyonse. dongosolo.",
    "literal.1554628ad103": "Onani msika",
    "literal.9f194d76fe9c": "Onani zamasamba",
    "literal.a4adec7fe60c": "Kulowa pa Facebook sikunakonzedwe.",
    "literal.95a347b954ff": "Mgwirizano wabwino",
    "literal.78797843e6e3":
      "zambiri zamakasitomala ndi zotsatiridwa ndi kasitomala, tram Osatengera zomwe zili patsamba kapena katundu wamtundu popanda chilolezo.",
    "literal.ca9cc88e7cb6": "Alimi",
    "literal.bda1c4b43d3a":
      "Farms akuyenera kukhala ndi satifiketi yaposachedwa ya NPOP kapena PGS-India, kuvomereza kutsata kolondola, ndikugwira ntchito ndi kupezeka kwanyengo m'malo mopereka zambiri mosadziwika. Othandizana nawo ayenera kusindikiza, mphero kapena kulongedza m'magulu ang'onoang'ono okhala ndi madeti owonekera bwino.",
    "literal.c62c2967f9ec":
      "Mafamu amatipatsa mitengo nthawi ndi nthawi, nthawi yokolola isanakwane, ndipo amalipidwa potumiza—osati kugulitsa kwathu. Magulu monga Anandvan amagawana phindu potengera malo omwe aperekedwa.",
    "literal.32b1045d5cfa": "Mayankho ofulumira a maoda, zotumizira, ndi mafunso azinthu.",
    "literal.5234f11bdf7e": "Choyamba, tsimikizirani foni yanu",
    "literal.7384e7db2d84": "Konzani vuto",
    "literal.1416b313e069": "Florings and oil kapena masiku okolola omwe akuwonekera pa paketi.",
    "literal.2e2b05c73fd0":
      "Kuti muthandizidwe kuitanitsa, phatikizani zolozera zanu. Pamafunso afamu kapena zamalonda, phatikizani dzina la malonda ndi mzinda.",
    "literal.4c29f7f03358": "Mwayiwala mawu achinsinsi?",
    "literal.f313d52bc92a": "Zomwe zimawonjezedwa pafupipafupi",
    "literal.37d4fef3bbe1": "Zomwe zimagulidwa pafupipafupi",
    "literal.64724410034b":
      "Zogulitsa zatsopano komanso zazing'ono zimatha kugulitsidwa kapena kusintha malinga ndi zokolola. Ngati dongosolo lotsimikizika silingakwaniritsidwe, chithandizo chidzakupatsani m'malo, kubweza ndalama kapena ngongole.",
    "literal.024e0bbc2808":
      "Chakudya chatsopano sichichedwa kuchedwa, choncho zobweza zimaperekedwa kudzera muzithunzi, zambiri zamagulu ndi kuunikanso mwachangu m'malo mokufunsani kuti mutumizenso zokolola.",
    "literal.ae43d74ec066": "Zipatso zatsopano",
    "literal.10d88756fdeb":
      "Zokolola zatsopano komanso kutsika pang'ono kwa nyengo kuchokera ku netiweki yafamu yotsimikizika ya True Grit.",
    "literal.45de21d770ad":
      "Zokolola zatsopano zimatsata makalendala okolola ndipo zimatumizidwa m'mizere yokonzedwa sabata iliyonse.",
    "literal.85c8d2606382":
      "Zombo zotulutsa zatsopano pamasiku otumizidwa. Katundu wa pantry nthawi zambiri amachoka pamalo okwaniritsira mkati mwa masiku awiri ogwirira ntchito, ndikugwira ntchito mozizira ngati pakufunika.",
    "literal.38a4da7af005": "zenera lazogulitsa zatsopano",
    "literal.e1a5fa6fd5b5": "Kuchokera kwa makasitomala",
    "literal.e4b5620fa978": "Kuchokera pafamu kufika pakhomo pako",
    "literal.3a1863213b7d": "Kuchokera kukhitchini",
    "literal.0df17882c591": "Kuchokera dothi lomwelo",
    "literal.e8e1b5046040": "Kuchokera pafamuyi",
    "literal.ff4a9ac0c49d": "kuchokera kumagulidwe otsimikizika",
    "literal.1c246a022284": "Kukwaniritsidwa:",
    "literal.eeb692087d62": "Dzina lonse",
    "literal.a09066301ab8": "Zikuyenda bwino ndi",
    "literal.79fc372dc790": "Zabwino kudziwa",
    "literal.e4628ceb88eb": "Kulowa mu Google sikunakonzedwe.",
    "literal.71a6cee5d894":
      "Muli ndi njira yoti mugawane? Tsitsani kwa anthu ammudzi ndipo akonzi athu adzaunikanso.",
    "literal.ddfbcf5040f4":
      "Zobiriwira zimadulidwa msanga, zimaziziritsidwa mwachangu komanso zimayikidwa patsogolo pamipata yobweretsera njira zazifupi.",
